    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/1e/Falotteqbulb.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240501024209\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Falotteqbulb\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"931\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Falotteqbulb.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Falotteqbulb.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/1e/Falotteqbulb.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240501024209\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>夜光者</b>\n</p><p>一位美丽的战士，提着一盏微亮的灯笼。作为她城镇的夜间守望者。她惩罚那些利用夜深人静行恶之人。\n\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"ae5b3b6150bca1bc44a1b909c7c56fd2\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"SFalotteqbulb-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:72px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:SFalotteqbulb.jpg\" title=\"SFalotteqbulb.jpg (289 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:72px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/0/06/SFalotteqbulb.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/72?cb=20240501024310\" title=\"SFalotteqbulb.jpg (289 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"SFalotteqbulb.jpg\" data-image-key=\"SFalotteqbulb.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3